  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Complementary support for Irrigation rehabilitation activities in Hama, Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of rehabilitating the filed irrigation system in Hama Centre sub-district is to enhance resilience of local farmers, negatively affected by climate changes, eleven years of the Syrian crisis and the recent earthquake that hit the region in February 2023. The proposed activities will help farmers reviving their agricultural activities and sustainably use the available natural resources in the targeted area.</narrative>
  </description>
